Synix e tla dira backup ya dedicated.yaml, e tlhabolose fela seemo/tlhopho ya poloko, le go boloka phitlhelelo ya seva e e tsamaelanang. Difaele tsa lefatshe tse di leng teng ga di fetolwe. A o batla go dirisa thulaganyo eno mo thulaganyong e e latelang?

